iscale e ottimizzazione carico\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCrediti Transizione 5.0: iper ammortamento 280%\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCrediti Industria 4.0 e digitalizzazione\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSwitch regimi (forfettario/semplificato/ordinario)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDeduzioni e agevolazioni personalizzate\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHolding e patrimoni familiari\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eInterpelli e ruling fiscali\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gc-pl ent-pl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003e04\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"__BASEURL__/servizi/apertura-e-gestione-p-iva/\"\u003eApertura e Gestione P.IVA\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eApertura Partita IVA (AA9/12, AA7/10, ComUnica)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eScelta codice ATECO e regime fiscale ottimale\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIscrizione Registro Imprese/SCIA\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRegime forfettario: verifica requisiti\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePassaggio da dipendente a P.IVA\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCessazione/sospensione attivit\u0026#224;\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gc-pl ent-pl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003e05\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"__BASEURL__/servizi/fatturazione-elettronica/\"\u003eFatturazione Elettronica\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eGestione fatturazione B2B/B2C/PA\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIntegrazione gestionali/e-commerce/POS\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eConservazione sostitutiva a norma (10 anni)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSistema di Interscambio (SdI)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFatture differite/acquisti intra-UE\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAutomazione workflow fatturazione\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gc-pl ent-pl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003e06\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"__BASEURL__/servizi/contabilita-e-bilancio/\"\u003eContabilit\u0026#224; e Bilancio\u